  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2400\">\n<p data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2400\"><strong data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2340\">Result:</strong> Positive / Negative for hypersensitivity to <strong data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2398\">Lidocaine</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2481\">\n<p data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2481\">Clinical correlation advised with patient's history and prior drug exposure.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2680\">\n<p data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2505\"><strong data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2503\">Recommendation:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2680\">\n<li data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2569\">\n<p data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2569\">Avoid use of Lidocaine in future procedures (if positive)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2643\">\n<p data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2643\">Consider alternate local anesthetics (e.g., Bupivacaine, Articaine)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2680\">\n<p data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2680\">Allergy card advised for patient.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
